OL,5,G0350 Witness History
OL,6,     FIn 1935, tens of thousands who had
OL,7,     Ffollowed Mao Zedong on the Long
OL,8,     FMarch across China struggled to
OL,9,     Fsurvive. They were fleeing Chiang
OL,10,     FKai-shek's Nationalist forces.
